<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Time Warner said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Time Warner said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette analyst Dennis Leibowitz reduced the rating on Time Warner Inc to buy from recommended list buy, citing the stock price, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- Shares dropped one to 44.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
